{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>俄羅斯、烏克蘭及美國三方和談結束後，美方談判代表轉到俄羅斯，並與總統普京會面。</p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普的女婿庫什納、總統特使威特科夫周四抵達莫斯科，在俄羅斯總統特使德米特里耶夫陪同，前往克里姆林宮與普京會面。庫什納提到歐洲有意參與和談，並結束烏克蘭危機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.UKRAINE-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WnPQBCvYnB1794495413.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>普京表示，俄方從未反對與歐洲對話，亦希望烏克蘭實現永久和平，但外國軍隊駐守烏克蘭是不可接受。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.UKRAINE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gBawdR6Y7H1794495506.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>早前在阿聯酋阿布扎比舉行的俄烏美三方和談，就交換戰俘達成協議，但在主要議題仍有重大分歧。庫什納和威特科夫之後會到愛爾蘭，與烏克蘭總統澤連斯基會面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:43:55.501033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.621419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:37:16.896759+00:00","content_hash":"dc956ac2b73172cbc9d242b3caaba9050f8a691babd110f235774f42e6ab0a53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:43:55.501033+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}